@step Apply persists the reviewed suggestion.
@static aeat app ledger classify <transaction-id> --llm --apply
@blocked external-service Needs the on-host local model runtime and its reader models, which the hermetic sandbox does not run.
@step Reject records the model as wrong, with your reason, in history.
@static aeat app ledger classify <transaction-id> --llm --reject --reason "this is personal"
@blocked external-service Needs the on-host local model runtime and its reader models, which the hermetic sandbox does not run.
